Any provisions of laws, executive order, rule or regulation to the contrary notwithstanding, the salaries of officials and employees of the Veterans Memorial Hospital are hereby standardized in accordance with the WAPCO classification and pay plan as follows:
a. Director of Veterans Memorial Hospital, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 70, per annum :
b. Assistant Director, Chief of Professional Staff, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 68, per annum ;
c. Assistant Chief of Professional Staff, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 67, per annum ;
d. Hospital Department Head (Medical Specialist III), at the salary rate of WAPCO range 66, per annum ;
e. Medical Specialist II, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 64, per annum ;
f. Administrative Officer III, Nursing Consultant and Fiscal Comptroller, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 63, per annum ;
g. Medical Specialist I, Chief of Service and Division (none-medical), Health and Hospital Inspector, Senior Executive Assistant II, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 62, , per annum ;
h. Supervising Management Analyst I (Assistant Controller) at the salary rate of WAPCO range 61, per annum ;
i. Senior Clinic Physician, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 60, per annum ;
j. Senior Resident Physician, Clinic Supervisor I, Budget Officer III, Assistant Chief Accountant III (Assistant Chief, Accounting Division) at the salary rate of WAPCO range 59, per annum ;
k. Assistant Chief Nurse IV (Assistant Chief, Nursing Service) and Dietitic Management Supervisor at the salary rate of WAPCO range 58, per annum ;
l. Senior Clinical Psychologist, Senior Dental Training Officer (Assistant Chief, Dental Service), Medical Social Work Supervisor (Assistant Chief, Social Service) a Principal Buyer (Assistant Chief Supply Division), at salary rate of WAPCO range 57, per annum ;
m. Senior Executive Assistant I and Accountant III (Assistant Chief, Finance Division), at the salary rate of WAPCO range 56, per annum ;
n. Resident Physician, Clinic Physician, and Junior Physician, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 55, per annum ;
o. Clinical Psychologist, Personnel Officer (Assistant Chief Internal Audit), at the salary rate of WAPCO range 54, per annum ;
p. Budget Officer I, Chief Nurse II, Management analyst II, Architect II Assistant Chief, Engineering Division), Administrative Assistant II (Assistant Chief, Medical Administrative Division), Pharmacy Training Officer (Assistant Chief, Pharmacy Service), RegionaI Training Nurse and Assistant Special Service Officer (Assistant Chief Special Service), at the salary rate of WAPCO range 53 per annum ;
q. Cashier III, Dental Training Officer, Dietitian IV, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 52, per annum ;
r. Security Officer II, Supply Officer III, Accountant II, Public Relations Officer I, Supervising Nurse Instructor, at the salary rate of WAPCO range, 51, per annum ;
s. Legal Officer II, Training Officer, Management Analyst I Budget Examiner II, Supervising Operating Room Nurse and Hospital Housekeeper (Assistant Chief, Building Management Division) at the salary rate of WAPCO range 50, per annum ;
t. Religious Guidance Adviser, Supervising Offset Press Operator I, Orthopedic Technologist, Fiscal Examiner II, Supervising Librarian I, Supervising Medical Social Worker, Mechanical Repair Shop Foreman, Accountant I, Cashier II, Auditing Examiner II, Dentist II, Assistant Chief Nurse II, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 49, per annum ;
u. Dietitian III, Supervising Pharmacist, Senior Buyer, Nurse Instructor II, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 48, per annum ;
v. Occupational Therapy Supervisor, Physical Therapy Supervisor, Guidance Psychologist, Supervising Clerk II, supervising Offset Operator, Senior Librarian, Records Officer II, Legal Officer I, Bookkeeper II, Auditing Examiner I, Fiscal Examiner One, Senior x-ray Therapeutic Nurse, Supervising Nurse, Senior Operating Room Nurse, Dormitory Manager II, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 47, per annum ;
w. Security Officer I. Property Custodian II, Supervising Mechanic, Dentist I, Recreation Officer, Cashier I Junior Mechanical Electrical Engineer, Carpenter General foreman, and Radio Producer Announcer I, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 46, per annum ;
x. Secretary, Stenographic Reporter, Supply Officer I Foreman, Electrician, Dietitian II, Medical Social Worker Auditing Aide II, Buyer, Plumber Foreman, Veteran Claims Investigator, Bookkeeper I, X-ray Therapeutic Nurse. Senior Pharmacist, and Senior Accounting Machine Operator at the salary rate of WAPCO range 45, per annum ;
y. Supervising Clerk I, Legal Aide II, Postmaster II, Senior Storekeeper, Medical Records Librarian, Senior Personnel Aide, Senior Nurse, Senior EEG Technician Operating Room Nurse, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 44, per annum ;
z. Disbursing Officer, Radio Technician, Senior Accounting Clerk, Occupational Therapist, Dietitian I, Reference Librarian, Head Telephone Operator, Laundry Foreman, Photographer II, Optometrist, and Physical Therapist at the salary rate of WAPCO range 43, per annum ;
