(cc) Medical Technician, Accounting Machine Operator I Motor Pool Dispatcher, Junior Librarian, Statistical Aide II, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 40, per annum (dd) Offset Press Operator I, Clerk II, Postal Clerk II Accounting Clerk II, Personnel Aide, Assistant Buyer, Mechanical Plant Operator II, Budget Aide, Fiscal Clerk II, Telephone Technician, Senior Plumber, Senior Painter, Shop Electrician, Mechanic II, Automotive Mechanic II, Heavy Equipment Operator, Senior Cook, Audio-Visual Equipment operator, Therapeutic Technician, Food Service Supervisor I, Senior X-ray Technician, Building Maintenance Foreman I, and Auto Mechanic II, at the salary rate of WAPCO range 39, per annum :
